{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼パイナップル美味／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/0760435/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は岡山県\nRSK 60th 感謝祭だヨ！\n全員集合！！\nに出演しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/0760435/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリは長野と一緒！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/0760435/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見ろー！ぐっちゃぐちゃだーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/0760435/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方が来てくださって\n嬉しかったーーーー><\n声援も聞こえました。\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岡山っておいしいものいっぱい。\nきびだんご買ったよ。黒ごまの←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/11/0760435/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑汗をかわかしてもらってる様子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一言更新ですみません。\n今からお昼ご飯食べるーうららー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}